{"unit_id":"xyzYaeMiko__dsh-session-groups#card-zh","repo":"xyzYaeMiko/dsh-session-groups","commit":"5d3d60cd31b7803db21f130ee9b9f1154e4842dd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Groups 是一款面向 DSH Web 侧栏的会话整理插件，通过替换工作区侧栏视图并保留原版视图切换入口，把会话显示为可管理的彩色分组。用户可以创建、嵌套、折叠和重命名分组，拖动会话与分组调整顺序，并按工作区树或单列表浏览；侧栏还汇总会话状态并展示子代理。内置 session_groups 工具可读取工作区与分组，并在用户审核通过后应用整理方案。适合会话较多、需要按项目归类或借助 AI 整理侧栏的 DSH 用户。分组视图状态保存在浏览器本地，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:6190-6227","client.js:563-568","index.js:365-503"]}
{"unit_id":"xyzYaeMiko__dsh-session-groups#card-en","repo":"xyzYaeMiko/dsh-session-groups","commit":"5d3d60cd31b7803db21f130ee9b9f1154e4842dd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Groups organizes DSH Web sidebar sessions into colored, collapsible groups. Drag to reorder, browse workspaces as a tree or one list, and view session and subagent status. The session_groups tool reads and reorganizes groups after user approval. Preferences stay in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:6190-6227","client.js:563-568","index.js:365-503"]}
